foundry-emulators-consoles (1.0.3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add xemu (Foundry apt), the original Xbox emulator. It is not in Ubuntu
    26.04 universe, so it is packaged by Foundry.
  * Placed here rather than in foundry-emulators-consoles-heavy: the heavy
    bucket's criterion is installation footprint, and xemu measures ~8 MiB
    of marginal dependency closure over the existing light console set
    (libslirp0, libssl3t64, libusb-1.0-0, openssl-provider-legacy) plus a
    ~16 MB binary. See docs/plans/2026-08-05-package-xemu.md.

 -- Foundry Linux <packages@foundrylinux.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

foundry-emulators-consoles (1.0.2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add bsnes-jg (Foundry apt), the cycle-accurate SNES / Super Famicom emulator
    (Jolly Good Emulation fork of bsnes), as an accuracy reference alongside
    snes9x-gtk.

